  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Dataset and preparation",
      "items": [
        "Fakeddit dataset (provided by the faculty): multimodal_train.tsv, multimodal_validate.tsv and multimodal_test_public.tsv preserve official split assignments.",
        "Text uses all 682,661 rows: 564,000 train / 59,342 validation / 59,319 test. For image pairing, 491 approved strict-decode failures are excluded; usable pairs: 563,601 / 59,299 / 59,270.",
        "Six weakly supervised categories: True, Satire/Parody, Misleading, Imposter, False Connection, Manipulated. Labels do not prove factual truth.",
        "Dataset (provided by the faculty): https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DuH0YaEox08ZwzZDpRMOaFpMCeRyxiEF"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Verified results and evaluation",
      "items": [
        "Text-only BERT validation accuracy 82.7407%, test accuracy 82.3901%; selected by validation Macro-F1.",
        "Text + image epoch 4 validation accuracy 88.5074%, Macro-F1 0.829303; frozen public-test accuracy 88.1458%, Macro-F1 0.826415.",
        "Kaggle Tesla T4: four multimodal epochs and validations; frozen selection before final test. Results, predictions, checksums and reports were independently checked; private weights remain in cloud/local storage."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Uncertainties and interpretation",
      "items": [
        "Paper and released sample counts differ by 335; cohort exclusions and training pipeline differ from the original benchmark.",
        "3,561 cross-split image-byte groups present a leakage risk; one seed does not establish statistical superiority.",
        "Image-only training has not started. ModernBERT was prepared but not trained in the text experiment.",
        "Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/1911.03854 · Dataset release: https://github.com/entitize/Fakeddit"
      ]
    }
  ]
